# Call the Spirit Dragons: "for each color, put a +1/+1 counter on a Dragon you control of that color." Kheru Goldkeeper (3/3, black,
# green and blue) is Bot1's only Dragon, so at the next upkeep black, blue and green each find it alone: each is asked and has only the one to choose, red and
# white find none and are skipped, and it gets three counters, one per color (6/6). Then Mutable Explorer (a green changeling, 1/1) comes
# down: at the following upkeep green has two Dragons to choose between and Bot1 picks the Explorer, so Kheru gets black and blue only
# (8/8) and the Explorer gets green (2/2). Counters on fewer than five Dragons win nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Call the Spirit Dragons
Kheru Goldkeeper
Mutable Explorer
Island x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x30

